  "rules": [
    "Reject unlisted transitions.",
    "Require expected state_version; increment atomically.",
    "Worker cannot write authoritative state transitions.",
    "DEPLOYING cancellation requires release reconciliation; never auto-pretend rollback.",
    "A terminal state is not changed by reusing an expired worker result.",
    "Precontract states carry contract_id null and revision 0; RUNNING requires a persisted contract and scope.",
    "Resume targets come from controller-owned reconciled state, not a client or worker-selected guard.",
    "New requirements during active work revoke affected leases and invalidate candidate/approval references atomically; no stale attempt can integrate.",
    "A late message during DEPLOYING records new intent but does not pretend an external deployment was cancelled; release service reconciles first."
  ]
